{"4132070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drive You Crazy Golf", "steam_appid": 4132070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLE-IN-1, HOLE-IN-2 AND HOLE-IN-3 ONLY COURSES. ZERO MERCY.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive You Crazy Golf is a brutal mini-golf challenge for 1-6 players. Have as many tries as you need - but every hole MUST be beaten in less than the maximum strokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For <strong>hole-in-1 courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-1</strong> will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For <strong>hole-in-2 courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-2 or less</strong>, will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hole-in-3 <strong>courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-3 or less</strong>, will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.poster.avif?t=1786926146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.webm?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.mp4?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO WAYS TO SUFFER (AND LAUGH):</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Classic Mode – Conquer 220+ hand-crafted holes. 12 unique courses to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Punishment Mode – Miss your hole-in-one and you’re sent back to the previous hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Both modes and courses are fully playable solo or in 1–6 player co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/eb267ec461d24863e121cb53f4082e16.poster.avif?t=1786926146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/eb267ec461d24863e121cb53f4082e16.webm?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/eb267ec461d24863e121cb53f4082e16.mp4?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHY YOU’LL LOVE (AND HATE) IT:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each of the 220+ holes is packed with shifting platforms, spinning traps, lava hazards and explosives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing, power and precision all matter - but nothing feels better than finally sinking that perfect shot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punishment Mode turns up the chaos even more: if your friend misses, you all go back. It’s hilarious, painful and guaranteed to destroy friendships.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/562d13432350529d64808f8170bb4da9.poster.avif?t=1786926146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/562d13432350529d64808f8170bb4da9.webm?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/562d13432350529d64808f8170bb4da9.mp4?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⛳ 220+ hand-crafted holes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 Dynamic hazards - lava balls, fans, spinning traps, collapsing floors and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Physics-based gameplay that’s equal parts skill and chaos.<br>👥 Local and online play for up to 6 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Two rage-inducing game modes designed for pain and laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/f0732074d7596c31df0573fb9888c12f.poster.avif?t=1786926146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/f0732074d7596c31df0573fb9888c12f.webm?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/f0732074d7596c31df0573fb9888c12f.mp4?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FROM THE SOLO DEV (NESSIE)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m a solo developer from the UK who grew up loving chaotic mini-golf videos like Vanoss Crew’s “Hole-in-One Challenges.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to turn that concept into an actual game - then make it even more punishing with a mode that sends you back when your friend misses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I was also inspired by “Sky Golf” if you ever played that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks for checking out Drive You Crazy Golf - your support means the world. 💚</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf through the tears together!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HOLE-IN-1, HOLE-IN-2 AND HOLE-IN-3 ONLY COURSES. ZERO MERCY.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive You Crazy Golf is a brutal mini-golf challenge for 1-6 players. Have as many tries as you need - but every hole MUST be beaten in less than the maximum strokes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For <strong>hole-in-1 courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-1</strong> will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For <strong>hole-in-2 courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-2 or less</strong>, will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hole-in-3 <strong>courses</strong>, you get infinite tries, but only a <strong>hole-in-3 or less</strong>, will move you to the next hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.poster.avif?t=1786926146\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.webm?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132070/extras/e23ff63facd78aa8f7cfeeb8689f6654.mp4?t=1786926146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TWO WAYS TO SUFFER (AND LAUGH):</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Classic Mode – Conquer 220+ hand-crafted holes. 12 unique courses to be beaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔁 Punishment Mode – Miss your hole-in-one and you’re sent back to the previous hole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 Both modes and courses are fully playable solo or in 1–6 player co-op.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i